<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 11     June 10   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.600     272.800     247.020   10.36 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.330     309.930     306.830    0.81 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.000     159.230     158.970    0.02 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.004	47.086	47.182   -0.38 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  446.020     446.740     419.180    6.40 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.325     141.510     141.685   -0.25 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.121	16.099	16.185   -0.40 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  245.360     242.500     212.430   15.50 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.879	 1.881	 1.888   -0.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.570	 1.571	 1.581   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.685     189.000     183.135    3.58 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
